hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15536","Mutamir ibn Sulayman narrated to us, he said: I heard Muhammad ibn Fada narrating, from his father, from Alqamah ibn Abdullah, from his father, he said: The Prophet of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) forbade breaking the current coinage of the Muslims current among them, except for a defect."
